  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Pacific Fisheries - Integrated Programmatic Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support in&#xA0;delivery and evaluation of New Zealand&apos;s Sustainable Pacific Fisheries portfolio (2024-2028) which seeks to address persistent regional challenges to sustainable fisheries management, including Illegal, Unreported and Unregulated fishing (particularly for offshore fisheries).&#xA0;To provide integrated implementation, monitoring and evaluation support across the&#xA0;Sustainable Pacific Fisheries&#xA0;portfolio, focused on strong risk, relationship and adaptive management approaches.</narrative>
  </description>
